## Boundary Notes

- Provider dispatch success, provider availability, or prompt rendering is not
  completion evidence.
- Required role coverage is clean only when the role's declared primary or
  secondary provider candidate succeeds.
- If primary and secondary both fail for a required role, report the unresolved
  role to 주군/operator and fail closed. Do not silently try undeclared tertiary,
  premium, alternate, or waiver-as-clean coverage.
- This disposition does not claim KAB-backed execution or KAH MAR gate support.
